flowchart TD
    Start([Start Conversation]) --> UserInput[User Sends Message]
    
    UserInput --> AnalyzeInput[Analyze User Input]
    AnalyzeInput --> InputType{Message Type?}
    
    InputType -->|Question| ProcessQuestion[Process Design Question]
    InputType -->|Feedback| ProcessFeedback[Process Design Feedback]
    InputType -->|Request| ProcessRequest[Process Design Request]
    InputType -->|Clarification| ProvideAnswer[Provide Clarification]
    
    ProcessQuestion --> LoadContext[Load Project Context]
    ProcessFeedback --> LoadContext
    ProcessRequest --> LoadContext
    
    LoadContext --> FormulateResponse[Formulate AI Response]
    ProvideAnswer --> FormulateResponse
    
    FormulateResponse --> ActionRequired{Action Required?}
    
    ActionRequired -->|No| SendResponse[Send Text Response]
    ActionRequired -->|Update Diagram| UpdateDiagram[Update Design Asset]
    ActionRequired -->|Create Diagram| CreateDiagram[Create New Design Asset]
    ActionRequired -->|Generate Prompt| GeneratePrompt[Generate Code Prompt]
    
    UpdateDiagram --> NotifyChanges[Notify About Changes]
    CreateDiagram --> NotifyChanges
    GeneratePrompt --> NotifyCreation[Notify About Prompt]
    
    NotifyChanges --> SendResponse
    NotifyCreation --> SendResponse
    
    SendResponse --> UserReaction{User Reaction}
    
    UserReaction -->|New Message| UserInput
    UserReaction -->|Views Asset| ViewAsset[View Updated Asset]
    UserReaction -->|No Response| End([End Conversation])
    
    ViewAsset --> UserReaction
